<title>UK: Go-Ahead H1 pretax rises to 12.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Go-Ahead H1 pretax rises to 12.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  14.11		vs    12.69</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    2.15		vs     1.85</p>
<p> Pretax			 12.2		 vs     6.7</p>
<p> Turnover		    120.2		 vs    67.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The pretax profit has not accounted for preexceptional items of 4.2 million stg. The earnings per share for the period under review is basic with the adjusted EPS at 18.76 pence.</p>
<p>Full company name - Go Ahead Group Plc -- Reuter Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
